<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109554" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόχαλκ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>containing a mixture of
				copper,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				415b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κανοῦν χρυσοῦν ὑπόχαλκον</span>”
				<i>bronze gilt,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					IG
					22.1407.21
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόχαλκον δέ σου τὸ χρυσίον</span>
			<u>Com.Adesp.</u> (?) ap.<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόχαλκον</span>
			: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				65a
			</span></i>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάργυρος,</span> etc.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sounding like copper,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἠχὼ φέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VA</u>
					3.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>of a copper colour,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷον ὑπόχαλκον τὴν μορφήν</span> (sc.
			the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶστρος</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύωψ</span>) Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				22.299
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
